{"3038620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starbump", "steam_appid": 3038620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/extras/de3084dcf8a5ad6fd1042c7d7f861305.avif?t=1779197909\" width=835 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>STARBUMP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce</strong>, <strong>bump</strong>, and <strong>blast your friends</strong> into space in the chaotic 4-player party platformer where no friendship survives intact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Starbump</strong></i> combines fast-paced action, Third Person platforming and competitive modes in vibrant worlds! Your couch becomes a launching pad for flying gummies and broken friendships!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/extras/02c1cf14da3cc0eaddc6ccc85df2a1c4.poster.avif?t=1779197909\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/extras/02c1cf14da3cc0eaddc6ccc85df2a1c4.webm?t=1779197909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>⭐ Why you’ll love Starbump</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starbump</strong> is what happens when a party game, a platformer, and a physics sandbox explode together. Every match is <strong>chaos</strong>, every jump is <strong>betrayal</strong> and every round ends with someone screaming “<strong>ONE MORE</strong>!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-player local chaos </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Remote Play Together supported!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-powered madness </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Throw, bump &amp; crash at high speed!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Arena, Rocketball, Parkour, Tag &amp; more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast matches = instant rematches</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero grind: all fun, no filler</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful worlds built for chaos, competition &amp; laughter only</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/extras/c52479b06e509bfd9d1a7076f43e8f5d.poster.avif?t=1779197909\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/extras/c52479b06e509bfd9d1a7076f43e8f5d.webm?t=1779197909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Multiplayer split-screen Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct game modes built for chaos: Parkour, Arena, Rocketball, Tag</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wacky weapons, physics-powered levels, colorful worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour</strong> - Race to the final platform through randomly generated sections. Fall and respawn! The first to finish ends the round for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena</strong> - Knock your friends out of the arena! Use wacky weapons and adapt to each arena’s gimmicks. Total chaos guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rocketball</strong> - Deflect rockets with a perfectly timed magic spin! Each hit makes it faster… until someone finally breaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag</strong> - Grab the crown and keep it as long as you can, while everyone else tries to steal it! Expect betrayals and last-second steals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More modes and worlds will be added over time.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/extras/1de1e3ccecbea22574ccdc2050f3de34.poster.avif?t=1779197909\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/extras/1de1e3ccecbea22574ccdc2050f3de34.webm?t=1779197909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📍Our roadmap </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>6 game modes</strong> planned for Early Access.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>intro adventure mode</strong> playable solo or in co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two new worlds</strong> (fire and ice) available at EA launch, with more added later as free updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access: Q2 2026</strong>, with a <strong>demo for Steam Next Fest</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full release <strong>2027</strong>, featuring <strong>online multiplayer</strong> and a <strong>complete adventure (story) mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future goals: console ports + online-specific modes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧐 Our Philosophy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>two independent developers</strong>, crafting everything <strong>by hand</strong>, with no AI.<br>No in-game purchases, no paid updates, no limited-time items: you pay <strong>once</strong>, and everything is i