ole ports + online-specific modes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧐 Our Philosophy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>two independent developers</strong>, crafting everything <strong>by hand</strong>, with no AI.<br>No in-game purchases, no paid updates, no limited-time items: you pay <strong>once</strong>, and everything is included, just like classic retro-era games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/extras/bb5a07c0cbbce6bbc46148609f19c759.poster.avif?t=1779197909\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/extras/bb5a07c0cbbce6bbc46148609f19c759.webm?t=1779197909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Starbump combines fast-paced action, Third Person platforming and competitive modes in vibrants worlds. It’s designed for party nights where you and your friends battle it out for hours, packed into colorful arenas and quick-fire game modes. It's a pure cozy brawl !", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/3c99888d9d268fd7924f4c42582993bd9aa1c3a7/header.jpg?t=1779197909", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/2f4a829dcfe907695a899ba09015de194b668203/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779197909", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038620/2f4a829dcfe907695a899ba09015de194b668203/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779197909", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later (64-Bit)<br>